"`DW_OP_LLVM_extract_bits_sext, 16, 8,` specifies the offset and size (`16` "
"and `8` here, respectively) of bits that are to be extracted and sign-"
"extended from the value at the top of the expression stack. If the top of "
"the expression stack is a memory location then these bits are extracted from "
"the value pointed to by that memory location. Maps into a `DW_OP_shl` "
"followed by `DW_OP_shra`."
