#: ../../../SourceLevelDebugging.md:590
msgid ""
"`DW_OP_LLVM_extract_bits_zext` behaves similarly to "
"`DW_OP_LLVM_extract_bits_sext`, but zero-extends instead of sign-extending. "
"Maps into a `DW_OP_shl` followed by `DW_OP_shr`."
